  "_why": "Every entry here MUST remain in package.json's ci:eval chain. A PR that edits ci:eval carries a snapshot of the whole 400+ entry string from whenever it branched, so merging it silently deletes every eval added since - and nothing goes red, because a deleted eval just stops running. Measured 2026-08-05: three PRs in one batch each carried a stale chain; #551 would have removed voice_next_step_promise, which #547 had added twelve minutes earlier. Additions need no change here. Removing an entry must be a DELIBERATE, reviewable edit to this file - never a silent merge artifact. Regenerate with: npx tsx scripts/ci_eval_chain_guard_eval.ts --update",
